{title: Lakshya Ko Har Haal Mai Paana Hai}
{artist: Shankar Mahadevan}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]Ha yehi rasta [Bb]hai tera,        Tu [F]ne ab jaana [Bb]hai
[F]ha yehi sapna [Bb]hai tera,        Tu [F]ne pehchana [Bb]hai
tujhe [Cm]ab yeh di [Gm]khana [F]hai,        [C]roke tujhko andhiya
[Bb]Ya zameen aur aasman,        Pa [F]yega jo [Bb]lakshya hai te [F]ra
Lakshya [C]ko har [Cm]haal me [Gm]pana [F]hai,        Mush [F]kil koi aa [C]jaye to
par [F]vat koi takraye to,        Ta [Bb]kat koi dikh [F]laye to
Too [Bb]fan koi mad [F]laye to,        Mush [Bb]kil koi aa [F]jaye to
par [Bb]vat koi tak [F]raye to,        Bar [F]se chahe ambar se aag
Lip [G]te chahe pairo se naag,        pa [Bb]yega jo lakshya hia te [F]ra
Lakshya [C]ko har [Cm]haal me [Gm]pana [F]hai,        Hi [F]mmat se jo ko [C]iii chale
dhar [F]ti hile kadmo tale,        Kya [F]dooriya kya [C]fasle
Man [F]zil lage aake gale,        Hi [Bb]mmat se jo ko [F]iii chale
dhar [Bb]ti hile kad [F]mo tale,        Tu [F]chal yoon hi subah o sham
Ruk [F]na zukna nahi tera kam,        pa [Bb]yega jo lakshya hia te [F]ra
Lakshya [C]ko har [Cm]haal me [Gm]pana [F]hai,        [F]Ha yehi rasta [Bb]hai tera
Tu [F]ne ab jaana [Bb]hai,        [F]ha yehi sapna [Bb]hai tera
Tu [F]ne pehchana [Bb]hai,        tujhe [Cm]ab yeh di [Gm]khana [F]hai
[C]roke tujhko andhiya,        [Bb]Ya zameen aur aasman
